<div class="gap-bottom-equal edu-about-area about-style-9" style="background:#0060ff2e; padding: 60px 10px;">
    <div class="container edublink-animated-shape">
        <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">

            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <div class="about-content">
                    <div class="section-title section-left sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">

                        <h2 class="title">Why Choose Sweden?</h2>
                        <span class="shape-line"><i class="icon-19"></i></span>

                    </div>
                    <ul class="features-list sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Globally Recognised Degree
                            <p class="fs-5">Sweden’s universities are celebrated for their cutting-edge research and teaching methods, consistently ranking among the world’s top institutions. They emphasize critical thinking, creativity, and collaboration, preparing students for global challenges.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Sustainability and Innovation
                            <p class="fs-5">As a global frontrunner in sustainability and innovation, Sweden integrates eco-conscious practices and groundbreaking technologies into its education system, offering students a chance to contribute to a greener, smarter future.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Wide Range of English-Taught Programs
                            <p class="fs-5">With over 1,000 programs taught in English, Sweden ensures international students can access diverse fields of study without language barriers, fostering a truly global learning environment.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Flexible Work and Career Opportunities
                            <p class="fs-5">Sweden allows international students to work part-time during their studies and provides post-graduation work permits, enabling them to gain practical experience and build a career in a thriving economy.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Generous Scholarships for International Students
                            <p class="fs-5">Sweden offers various scholarships, such as the Swedish Institute Scholarships, which significantly reduce tuition costs and make world-class education accessible to students from diverse financial backgrounds.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Safe and Welcoming Environment
                            <p class="fs-5">Ranked among the safest countries globally, Sweden boasts a progressive, inclusive society that warmly embraces international students, ensuring a secure and supportive living experience.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Study and earn simultaneously
                            <p class="fs-5">Legally work part-time during your studies. This helps cover living expenses, provides valuable work experience, and eases financial strain, all while maintaining your academic focus successfully.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Immersive Cultural and Natural Wonders
                            <p class="fs-5"> From exploring the magical Northern Lights to enjoying the vibrant urban life in Stockholm, Sweden offers a perfect mix of breathtaking landscapes and rich cultural heritage for students to enjoy.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Comprehensive Support for International Students
                            <p class="fs-5"> Swedish universities excel in providing tailored support services, including assistance with housing, visa processes, and cultural adaptation, ensuring students feel at home from day one.</p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4">
